# no operand spells the answer, so the engine makes it in the realm of the build: function loud() { return ["abc".toUpperCase()]; }
# RUN: walk f7 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+Folding
# CHECK-LABEL: code f7:Body
# CHECK: [[text]]: {{*}} = String string=made "ABC"
# CHECK: = NewArray [[text]]
# with folding withheld the engine is not asked
# RUN(WITHHELD): walk f7 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls
# WITHHELD-NOT: string=made "ABC"
# PROGRAM-OF: string-methods-on-known-texts-are-their-answers.ir
